    "prompt_template_cn": "写实国漫油画风修真UI组件，深青灰哑光金属底板 (#1E2B28)，暗金 (#C8A86A) 浮雕外描边与细内描边，表面细密祥云暗纹浮雕，中心主体为「{icon}」，{state}无文字无字母无数字，纯透明背景，绝对无背景无地面无投影无白边，高质量精细笔触，柔和体积光，4K级细节",
    "prompt_template_en": "realistic guoman oil-painting style xianxia UI component, dark teal-grey matte metal baseplate (#1E2B28), dark gold (#C8A86A) embossed outer and inner border, fine cloud-pattern relief on surface, center subject: {icon}, {state}no text no letters no numbers, pure transparent background, absolutely no background no floor no shadow no white edge, high quality fine brushwork, soft volumetric light, 4K detail",
